{"title": "Friend", "pageid": 19912, "url": "https://bg3.wiki/wiki/Friend", "categories": ["Misc items", "Common items"], "html": "<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><div role=\"note\" class=\"hatnote noexcerpt\">See also: <a href=\"/wiki/Friends\" title=\"Friends\">Friends</a>        </div>\n\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box bg3wiki-tooltip-gradient-common\"> <figure class=\"mw-default-size mw-halign-right\" typeof=\"mw:File/Frameless\"><a href=\"/wiki/File:Skull_A_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-description\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/9/95/Skull_A_Icon.webp/300px-Skull_A_Icon.webp, /w/images/9/95/Skull_A_Icon.webp 1.5x\"><img alt=\"Friend image\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/9/95/Skull_A_Icon.webp/300px-Skull_A_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"300\" height=\"300\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/9/95/Skull_A_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a><figcaption></figcaption></figure>\n<p><b>Friend</b> is a common <a href=\"/wiki/Miscellaneous\" title=\"Miscellaneous\">Miscellaneous</a> item. It appears to be an ordinary <a href=\"/wiki/Skull\" title=\"Skull\">skull</a> that was subject to the unwilling companionship and artistic expression of the quasit <a href=\"/wiki/Shovel_(Familiar)\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Shovel (Familiar)\">Shovel</a>. It can be sold for <a href=\"/wiki/Gold\" title=\"Gold\">gold</a> or bartered to a <a href=\"/wiki/Trader\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Trader\">trader</a>.\n\n</p>\n<div style=\"font-size:110%; font-family:'Linux Libertine', 'Georgia', serif; display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap;\">\n<div style=\"opacity: 0.5; margin: 0.5em 0.5em 0.5em 0;\"><span typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/5/5b/Description_Icon.png/24px-Description_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/5/5b/Description_Icon.png/36px-Description_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/5/5b/Description_Icon.png 2x\"><img src=\"/w/images/thumb/5/5b/Description_Icon.png/24px-Description_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/5/5b/Description_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></div>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-blockquote-text\" style=\"width:100px; flex-grow: 1; font-style: italic;\">\n<p>Everybrows, horns, and rosy cheeks have been drawn upon this skull in a number of bodily fluids.\n</p>\n</div></div>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Properties\"> Properties </span></h2>\n\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-property-list\">\n<ul><li><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Miscellaneous\" title=\"Miscellaneous\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/f/fe/Options_Icon.png/25px-Options_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/f/fe/Options_Icon.png 1.5x\"><img alt=\"Miscellaneous Items\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/f/fe/Options_Icon.png/25px-Options_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/f/fe/Options_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Miscellaneous\" title=\"Miscellaneous\">Miscellaneous Items</a></li>\n<li><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon bg3wiki-lightmode-drop-shadow\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/e/ef/Rarity_Icon.png/25px-Rarity_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/e/ef/Rarity_Icon.png/38px-Rarity_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/e/ef/Rarity_Icon.png 2x\"><img alt=\"Rarity: Common\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/e/ef/Rarity_Icon.png/25px-Rarity_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/e/ef/Rarity_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> Rarity: Common</li>\n<li><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon bg3wiki-lightmode-drop-shadow\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/e/ea/Weight_Icon.png/25px-Weight_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/e/ea/Weight_Icon.png/38px-Weight_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/e/ea/Weight_Icon.png 2x\"><img alt=\"Weight: 0.1 kg (0.2 lb)\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/e/ea/Weight_Icon.png/25px-Weight_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/e/ea/Weight_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> Weight: 0.1 kg (0.2 lb)</li>\n<li><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/2/26/Gold_Icon.png/25px-Gold_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/2/26/Gold_Icon.png 1.5x\"><img alt=\"Price: 1 gp\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/2/26/Gold_Icon.png/25px-Gold_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/2/26/Gold_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> Price:  1  gp</li></ul>\n</div>   \n<div style=\"clear: both;\"></div></div>\n    <h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Where_to_find\"> Where to find </span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box\">\n<ul><li>In the Mouldering Casket in the <a href=\"/wiki/Apothecary%27s_Cellar\" title=\"Apothecary's Cellar\">Apothecary's Cellar</a> at <span class=\"bg3wiki-coordinates\">X:&nbsp;666&nbsp;Y:&nbsp;-333</span></li></ul>\n</div>   <h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Notes\"> Notes </span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box\">\n<ul><li>This item can be found alongside <span class=\"nowrap bg3wiki-icontext-icon\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-itemicon bg3wiki-itemicon-common\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Poo-Scraper\" title=\"Poo-Scraper\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/8/83/Rusty_Dagger_Unfaded_Icon.png/20px-Rusty_Dagger_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/8/83/Rusty_Dagger_Unfaded_Icon.png/30px-Rusty_Dagger_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/8/83/Rusty_Dagger_Unfaded_Icon.png/40px-Rusty_Dagger_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/8/83/Rusty_Dagger_Unfaded_Icon.png/20px-Rusty_Dagger_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/8/83/Rusty_Dagger_Unfaded_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Poo-Scraper\" title=\"Poo-Scraper\">Poo-Scraper</a> and several of <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon bg3wiki-round-image\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Shovel_(familiar)\" title=\"Shovel (familiar)\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/1/17/Portrait_Shovel.png/25px-Portrait_Shovel.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/1/17/Portrait_Shovel.png/38px-Portrait_Shovel.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/1/17/Portrait_Shovel.png/50px-Portrait_Shovel.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Shovel's\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/1/17/Portrait_Shovel.png/25px-Portrait_Shovel.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/1/17/Portrait_Shovel.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Shovel_(familiar)\" title=\"Shovel (familiar)\">Shovel's</a> other personal possessions.</li>\n<li>Presumably acquired through the use of <span class=\"nowrap bg3wiki-icontext-icon\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-itemicon bg3wiki-itemicon-common\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Shovel%27s_Friend-Finder\" title=\"Shovel's Friend-Finder\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/7/73/Shovel_Unfaded_Icon.png/20px-Shovel_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/7/73/Shovel_Unfaded_Icon.png/30px-Shovel_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/7/73/Shovel_Unfaded_Icon.png/40px-Shovel_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/7/73/Shovel_Unfaded_Icon.png/20px-Shovel_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/7/73/Shovel_Unfaded_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Shovel%27s_Friend-Finder\" title=\"Shovel's Friend-Finder\">Shovel's Friend-Finder</a>.</li></ul>\n</div>   \n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20260714203007\nCache expiry: 86400\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: [vary‐revision‐sha1, no‐toc]\nCPU time usage: 0.050 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.054 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 1973/1000000\nPost‐expand include size: 18174/4194304 bytes\nTemplate argument size: 6065/4194304 bytes\nHighest expansion depth: 22/200\nExpensive parser function count: 1/750\nUnstrip recursion depth: 0/20\nUnstrip post‐expand size: 2/5000000 bytes\nExtLoops count: 0/1000\nLua time usage: 0.015/7.000 seconds\nLua memory usage: 932985/52428800 bytes\n-->\n<!--\nTransclusion expansion time report (%,ms,calls,template)\n100.00%   44.076      1 -total\n 98.12%   43.248      1 Template:MiscItemPage\n 30.88%   13.611      2 Template:SmRarityItem\n 25.11%   11.066      2 Template:Item_icon\n 20.74%    9.140      5 Template:Icon_text\n 18.67%    8.231     22 Template:Trim\n 14.71%    6.485      1 Template:Main_only\n 12.74%    5.614      2 Template:Icon_link\n 11.91%    5.251      9 Template:Ifempty\n 10.40%    4.582      1 Template:PageSeo\n-->\n\n<!-- Saved in parser cache with key bg3wiki:pcache:idhash:19912-0!canonical an